{"entities":[{"pmid":"8268147","text":"polymyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017285","start":10,"end":22},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"primary biliary cirrhosis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D008105","start":41,"end":66},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"D-penicillamine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010396","start":80,"end":95},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"D-penicillamine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010396","start":106,"end":121},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"rheumatologic diseases","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D012216","start":145,"end":167},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"toxicity","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D064420","start":169,"end":177},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"Polymyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017285","start":218,"end":230},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"dermatomyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D003882","start":231,"end":246},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"D-penicillamine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010396","start":301,"end":316},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"primary biliary cirrhosis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D008105","start":397,"end":422},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"polymyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017285","start":438,"end":450},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"D-penicillamine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010396","start":467,"end":482},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"D-penicillamine","etype":"Chemical","mesh":"D010396","start":568,"end":583},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"polymyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D017285","start":674,"end":686},{"pmid":"8268147","text":"dermatomyositis","etype":"Disease","mesh":"D003882","start":687,"end":702}],"gold_relations":"D-penicillamine | CID | polymyositis","metrics":{"precision":0.25,"recall":1.0,"f1":0.4,"tp":1,"fp":3,"fn":0,"rel_precision":0.25,"rel_recall":1.0,"rel_f1":0.4,"rel_tp":1,"rel_fp":3,"rel_fn":0},"pmid":"8268147","relations":["D010396 | CID | D003882","D010396 | CID | D017285","D010396 | CID | D008105","D010396 | CID | D012216"],"text":"A case of polymyositis in a patient with primary biliary cirrhosis treated with D-penicillamine. Although D-penicillamine has been used for many rheumatologic diseases, toxicity limits its usefulness in many patients. Polymyositis/dermatomyositis can develop as one of the autoimmune complications of D-penicillamine treatment, but its exact pathogenesis remains unclear. We report a patient with primary biliary cirrhosis, who developed polymyositis while receiving D-penicillamine therapy. We described the special clinical course of the patient. Patients receiving D-penicillamine therapy should be followed carefully for the development of autoimmune complications like polymyositis/dermatomyositis."}